<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main>
  <div class="container">
    <article class="prose section">
      <h1>Privacy, Cookies &amp; Terms</h1>
      <p class="faint">Last updated: <%= updated %></p>

      <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p><%= siteName %> ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This directory does not require an account and we do not ask you for personal information to browse or search.</p>
      <p><strong>What we collect.</strong> We record anonymous, aggregate usage such as which tools are opened and what people search for (to decide what to add next). We do not sell your personal data.</p>
      <p><strong>Third parties.</strong> When ads are enabled, we use Google AdSense to display advertising. When you click through to a listed tool, you leave our site and that tool’s own privacy policy applies.</p>

      <h2 id="cookies">Cookie Policy</h2>
      <p>We use a small number of cookies:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Essential</strong> — remember your cookie choice and keep the site working.</li>
        <li><strong>Advertising</strong> — once enabled, Google and its partners may use cookies to serve and measure ads, including personalised ads where you consent. You can manage this from the cookie banner and in your Google Ad Settings.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can decline non-essential cookies using the banner shown on your first visit, or clear cookies in your browser at any time.</p>

      <h2>Your choices (GDPR / CCPA)</h2>
      <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct or delete data we hold, and to object to personalised advertising. Contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@onekitapp.com">privacy@onekitapp.com</a> to exercise these rights.</p>

      <h2 id="terms">Terms of Use</h2>
      <p><%= siteName %> is provided "as is". We link to third-party tools we do not own or control and cannot guarantee their availability, accuracy or safety. Always review a tool’s own terms before uploading sensitive files. We are not liable for any loss arising from your use of tools we link to.</p>

      <p><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/">← Back to home</a></p>
    </article>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
